":330681,"en":"And from that poor Black Giant’s"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0457:b003:l002","ordinal":330682,"en":"Two eyes the tears flowed,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0457:b003:l003","ordinal":330683,"en":"Streaming down his sacred mane."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0457:b003:l004","ordinal":330684,"en":"The sword had slipped from its sheath,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0457:b003:l005","ordinal":330685,"en":"Many of his words rang true;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0457:b003:l006","ordinal":330686,"en":"What he had seen of the bloodthirsty lion"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0457:b003:l007","ordinal":330687,"en":"Proved true, not false."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0457:b003:l008","ordinal":330688,"en":"At the soothsayer’s black cave,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0457:b003:l009","ordinal":330689,"en":"Where the path into the dark cavern was stained red,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0457:b003:l010","ordinal":330690,"en":"The elder and younger kinsmen,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0457:b003:l011","ordinal":330691,"en":"Külchoro and Semetey,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0457:b003:l012","ordinal":330692,"en":"Met upon the open plain."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0457:b003:l013","ordinal":330693,"en":"Külchoro wailed and wept,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0457:b003:l014","ordinal":330694,"en":"Steeling himself like a bird of prey,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0457:b003:l015","ordinal":330695,"en":"Pleading, “Elder brother!”"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0457:b003:l016","ordinal":330696,"en":"He seized the bridle"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0457:b003:l017","ordinal":330697,"en":"And turned the noble Buurul."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0457:b003:l018","ordinal":330698,"en":"When he saw the gray-maned lion,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0457:b003:l019","ordinal":330699,"en":"His heart was wrung;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0457:b003:l020","ordinal":330700,"en":"The tears flowing down both cheeks"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0457:b003:l021","ordinal":330701,"en":"Fell over his breast."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0457:b003:l022","ordinal":330702,"en":"The blood drained from his ruddy face,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0457:b003:l023","ordinal":330703,"en":"And Külchoro lost his strength;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0457:b003:l024","ordinal":330704,"en":"His heart was wrung,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0457:b003:l025","ordinal":330705,"en":"And the tears flowing from both eyes"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0457:b003:l026","ordinal":330706,"en":"Fell over his breast."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0457:b003:l027","ordinal":330707,"en":"His strength failed and he grew faint,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0457:b003:l028","ordinal":330708,"en":"His joints went slack and his life ebbed;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0457:b003:l029","ordinal":330709,"en":"His tiny soul became flame,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0457:b003:l030","ordinal":330710,"en":"When his true elder brother appeared."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0457:b003:l031","ordinal":330711,"en":"When he saw his true elder brother,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0457:b003:l032","ordinal":330712,"en":"The poor man could not endure it;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0457:b003:l033","ordinal":330713,"en":"His heart was pierced and torn apart."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0457:b003:l034","ordinal":330714,"en":"The precious lion had come into his hands,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0457:b003:l035","ordinal":330715,"en":"And this accursed, treacherous world"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0457:b003:l036","ordinal":330716,"en":"Seemed no broader than a handful."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0457:b003:l037","ordinal":330717,"en":"Külchoro and the Black Giant"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0457:b003:l038","ordinal":330718,"en":"Clung to the hero and wept,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0457:b003:l039","ordinal":330719,"en":"And the Argyn-Kyrgyz people wept"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0457:b003:l040","ordinal":330720,"en":"Because the gray-maned lion had vanished."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0458:b002:l001","ordinal":330721,"en":"If we set his blessed road before us,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0458:b002:l002","ordinal":330722,"en":"He would lead countless armies."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0458:b002:l003","ordinal":330723,"en":"The glory of the gated city,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0458:b002:l004","ordinal":330724,"en":"The city of the deep-rooted plane tree—"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0458:b002:l005","ordinal":330725,"en":"Brave Külchoro found him,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0458:b002:l006","ordinal":330726,"en":"And his lord was restored to the seat of honor;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0458:b002:l007","ordinal":330727,"en":"Thus the disgraced Choro’s"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0458:b002:l008","ordinal":330728,"en":"Honor was restored."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0458:b002:l009","ordinal":330729,"en":"“Is this waking,” he said, “or a dream?"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0458:b002:l010","ordinal":330730,"en":"Is this the lord I longed for?"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0458:b002:l011","ordinal":330731,"en":"Is this my gray-maned lion himself,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0458:b002:l012","ordinal":330732,"en":"The very eye of the tiger,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0458:b002:l013","ordinal":330733,"en":"Encountered as if by providence,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0458:b002:l014","ordinal":330734,"en":"Found upon the white plain,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0458:b002:l015","ordinal":330735,"en":"Met after vanishing on the road—"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0458:b002:l016","ordinal":330736,"en":"Is this my tiger himself?”"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0458:b002:l017","ordinal":330737,"en":"He would not release"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0458:b002:l018","ordinal":330738,"en":"The bridle of noble Buurul."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0458:b002:l019","ordinal":330739,"en":"Blazing with anguish, he gathered himself,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0458:b002:l020","ordinal":330740,"en":"And the noble warrior pleaded;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0458:b002:l021","ordinal":330741,"en":"Glowing and flaring like an ember,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0458:b002:l022","ordinal":330742,"en":"When he saw his lion of a hero,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0458:b002:l023","ordinal":330743,"en":"How could the sorrow-laden warrior"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0458:b002:l024","ordinal":330744,"en":"Possibly stand still?"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0458:b002:l025","ordinal":330745,"en":"Ripened and blazing like an ember,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0458:b002:l026","ordinal":330746,"en":"The wretched man who had seen his lord—"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0458:b002:l027","ordinal":330747,"en":"How could he endure and stand still?"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0458:b002:l028","ordinal":330748,"en":"Külchoro burned with a righteous flame,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0458:b002:l029","ordinal":330749,"en":"A bare sword hung at his side,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0458:b002:l030","ordinal":330750,"en":"And, pleading “Elder brother,”"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0458:b002:l031","ordinal":330751,"en":"Külchoro stood there burning."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0458:b002:l032","ordinal":330752,"en":"He remains rigid and takes no heed,"}]
